Bind Npc 14424 Zone 12
Quest 1023 "Unfinished Hunt III"
    Journal "Troll Captain is the target for this job!"
    Kill 40 of 1724, 1774 at direction_170

Requires player level >= 79 and player is elmorad and quest 346 is completed

Rewards
    Give 68750000 experience

direction_170 = location "Troll Captain" found "Eslant" at 740 845 in zone 12

On available
    Say "Master, what about another quest in Eslant?"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Are you looking for another quest? I like this attitude of ceaseless effort! Find the Troll Captain."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Given all the quests you have done so far, this quest may not be unreasonable..."

On in_progress
    Say "What about your quest?"
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_170

On ready
    Say "Master, you completed another quest!"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Another quest is completed. Well-done!"
